# Tier 363: Docker reads .dockerignore from the root of the BUILD CONTEXT.
# docker-compose.prod.yml and infra/prod/docker-compose.yml build this image
# with context ./frontend (../../frontend), so the repository-root
# .dockerignore — which says it covers "both backend & frontend build
# contexts" — never applied here, and `COPY . .` carried a developer's
# .env.local (NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:3001) into `next build`.
# The API base now comes only from the NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL build arg.
#
# Kept deliberately small: e2e/ stays in the context because
# playwright.config.ts imports from it and `next build` type-checks it.

# Env files (never bake these in)
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Rebuilt inside the image
node_modules
.next
out

# Test / tool artifacts
coverage
playwright-report
test-results
*.log

# VCS / OS
.git
.DS_Store
